  "goodToKnow": "Der Lieferant is a supplier: ein zuverlässiger Lieferant, Zulieferer (sub-suppliers, important in the car industry). It's a weak noun: den Lieferanten. Since 2023, Germany's Lieferkettengesetz (Supply Chain Act) has required large companies to check human rights and environmental standards among their suppliers. Der Lieferdienst is a delivery service, like for food. From liefern (to deliver). Plural: die Lieferanten."
